 "remarks": "Arch Hill Commons! This 4 Room, 1 Bedroom, 1 Bathroom condo with reserved parking & storage in popular well maintained building with beautifully landscaped. The hardwood floors to be refinished before closing. Any amenities you could want are minutes away, walk friendly location and the complex is pet friendly ( 2 cats or 1 dog 20Lbs ). You are within a few minutes drive to everything including Restaurants, bars, Maritime Aquarium, Oyster Shell Park, movie theater, food market, yoga studios, sport facilities and Metro North Train Station. Close proximity to the SONO Collection mall, Norwalk's Beaches and all the major highways. Kitchen ( 64 square feet ) - 9.1 x 7.0 : Entry ( 92 square feet ) - 14.3 x 6.4 : Bathroom ( 41 square feet ) - 6.11 x 5.11 : Coat Closet ( 12 square feet ) - 3.6 x 3.2 : Bedroom ( 179 square feet ) - 14.4 x 12.11 : Living Room ( 208 square feet ) - 15.11 x 13.2.",
